Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 06:03:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] refactor: remove dead, disconnected homepage-CMS layer

lib/cms/*, content/homepage.json and types/cms/* implemented a JSON-backed
content pipeline (getHomepageContent + zod schema) that no page or component
ever imported. It had also drifted out of sync with the live copy (its hero
said "Build faster with Macan" while the site shows the export/import
messaging from messages/*.json) and only modelled en+fa while the site ships
four locales. Removing it eliminates a misleading second source of truth.

A single, wired-up content layer is introduced later in this series.
